# Kaya, Spirits' Justice's -2: "For each other player, exile up to one target creature that player controls." (CR 601.2c, 115.1) In a
# three-player game there is a slot for each opponent. Bot1 exiles its own Memnite, Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot3's Memnite together; the opponents'
# creatures are not creatures Bot1 controlled, so only its own Memnite is among the cards to copy (Ornithopter is refused).

[Bot1 Deck]
Kaya, Spirits' Justice
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Island x3
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

